# In the Name of Science (otherAreas 76): the nosTrades table, the obis:
# Karin Obi, Hyorin Obi, Furin Obi, Dorin Obi, Rairin Obi, Suirin Obi, Korin Obi, Anrin Obi.
# Accepted, The Warriors' Path completed (current Emptiness Bleeds), a WAR 75. For each entry, from no target: the
# GMs give its base, a pie and its organs; its base traded: 526 (the base; the target set; the base taken); a script
# talk after the default 527: 532 or 528 with the base (the draw); the pie: 531 (pie, 0, the hint; taken); each organ
# one short: nothing (no target-0 base arm, no pie); the organs: 529 (Gorget, Silver Earring, Silver Obi); its finish:
# the entry's item, the target 0, completed (again after the first), the organs taken. Every reward is rare and
# different. Generated: tools/golden_in_the_name_of_science.py table obis.
char zone=TavnazianSafehold pos=82.5,-25.0,3.5 job=WAR lvl=75
mission Cop EmptinessBleeds current
quest OtherAreas.InTheNameOfScience accepted
login
item SilverObi                          # Karin Obi (15435, hint 1): its base, a pie, its organs (GMs)
item RedChip
item ApplePie
item PhuaboOrgan x7
item XzomitOrgan x3
item SampleOfLuminianTissue x3
trade Yurim SilverObi x1 RedChip x1     # no target: the Karin Obi base: target 15435; 526
finish                                  # the base taken
trigger Yurim                           # the default 527
finish
trigger Yurim                           # a target: 532 or 528 (Silver Obi, Red Chip)
finish
trade Yurim ApplePie x1                 # 531 (Apple Pie, 0, 1)
finish                                  # the pie taken
trade Yurim PhuaboOrgan x6 XzomitOrgan x3 SampleOfLuminianTissue x3  # one Phuabo Organ short: nothing
